    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/895431a7ce4505eab1511b1600da27e2.avif?t=1740179985\" width=616 height=250 /></span><br><br>Welcome, reincarnated in Fegefeuer!<br><br>This is Fegefeuer Soul Tower, an cozy adventure game within the Fegefeuer.<br><br>Fegefeuer is a mysterious world between Hell and Heaven.<br>Build a Home and Fight your way through the Soul Tower to finally reach Heaven.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/ffa71a8da6c768cf8c69bc00024d4b50.avif?t=1740179985\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/59c8992ac16414e3553c0b627b408b77.poster.avif?t=1740179985\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/59c8992ac16414e3553c0b627b408b77.webm?t=1740179985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/59c8992ac16414e3553c0b627b408b77.mp4?t=1740179985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Soul Tower has 100 floors that you have to overcome.<br>You can free NPCs in the Soul Tower to increase the capabilities of your home.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/85d775656f4ffa1312008432449e2555.avif?t=1740179985\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/dadc4564b462646849608958c20d8373.avif?t=1740179985\" width=616 height=250 /></span><br><br>Relax on your farm to craft and grow everything imaginable.<br>Perfect after a hard encounter in the Soul Tower.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/66b411258462d299e26c92f09f219875.avif?t=1740179985\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/08fc0f638d034243a654531814d6aa54.avif?t=1740179985\" width=616 height=250 /></span><br><br>Equipment and powerful Gems will drop. <br>Free the legendary Alchemist to unlock powerful potions and socket Gems in your Equipment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/347969a5feac0f3b983d0ad8082329d7.avif?t=1740179985\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/a22fbf1c7f0cf973cf675c7097115019.avif?t=1740179985\" width=616 height=250 /></span><br><br>Every journey is best with friends by your side.<br>Play with up to 4 Players through this epic adventure.<br><br>Can you escape from Fegefeuer and reach Heaven?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/978f2288dd9dbe4564e1b8e786271679.avif?t=1740179985\" width=616 height=250 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/895431a7ce4505eab1511b1600da27e2.avif?t=1740179985\" width=616 height=250 /></span><br><br>Welcome, reincarnated in Fegefeuer!<br><br>This is Fegefeuer Soul Tower, an cozy adventure game within the Fegefeuer.<br><br>Fegefeuer is a mysterious world between Hell and Heaven.<br>Build a Home and Fight your way through the Soul Tower to finally reach Heaven.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/ffa71a8da6c768cf8c69bc00024d4b50.avif?t=1740179985\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/59c8992ac16414e3553c0b627b408b77.poster.avif?t=1740179985\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/59c8992ac16414e3553c0b627b408b77.webm?t=1740179985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/59c8992ac16414e3553c0b627b408b77.mp4?t=1740179985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Soul Tower has 100 floors that you have to overcome.<br>You can free NPCs in the Soul Tower to increase the capabilities of your home.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/85d775656f4ffa1312008432449e2555.avif?t=1740179985\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/dadc4564b462646849608958c20d8373.avif?t=1740179985\" width=616 height=250 /></span><br><br>Relax on your farm to craft and grow everything imaginable.<br>Perfect after a hard encounter in the Soul Tower.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/66b411258462d299e26c92f09f219875.avif?t=1740179985\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/08fc0f638d034243a654531814d6aa54.avif?t=1740179985\" width=616 height=250 /></span><br><br>Equipment and powerful Gems will drop. <br>Free the legendary Alchemist to unlock powerful potions and socket Gems in your Equipment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/347969a5feac0f3b983d0ad8082329d7.avif?t=1740179985\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/a22fbf1c7f0cf973cf675c7097115019.avif?t=1740179985\" width=616 height=250 /></span><br><br>Every journey is best with friends by your side.<br>Play with up to 4 Players through this epic adventure.<br><br>Can you escape from Fegefeuer and reach Heaven?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578640/extras/978f2288dd9dbe4564e1b8e786271679.avif?t=1740179985\" width=616 height=250 /></span>",
